<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ClinicCare — Nidaamka Ballanqaadyada Rugta</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --deep: #071a17;
    --teal: #0d3b30;
    --mid: #145c47;
    --accent: #1d9e75;
    --gold: #c9a84c;
    --gold-light: #e8c97a;
    --cream: #f5f0e8;
    --cream2: #ede6d6;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --text-muted: rgba(245,240,232,0.55);
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.4rem 4rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    background: rgba(7,26,23,0.7);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
  }
  .logo {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--white);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .logo-dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold); display: inline-block;
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--gold); color: var(--deep);
    border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 2px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--gold-light); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7rem 4rem 4rem;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 70% 50%, rgba(13,59,48,0.9) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 60% at 20% 80%, rgba(29,158,117,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-grid-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    animation: gridDrift 20s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes gridDrift { from { background-position: 0 0; } to { background-position: 60px 60px; } }

  .hero-left { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s forwards;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: ''; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 5.5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s forwards;
  }
  .hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold-light); }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 440px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.6s forwards;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.8s forwards;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gold); color: var(--deep);
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem; border: none; border-radius: 2px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--gold-light); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(201,168,76,0.25); }
  .btn-ghost {
    color: var(--cream); border: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.25);
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem; border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 400; cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent; transition: all 0.2s; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }

  .hero-stats {
    display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.1);
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 1s forwards;
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--gold-light);
  }
  .stat-lbl { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  .hero-right {
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
    display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeIn 1.2s 0.5s forwards;
  }
  .phone-mock {
    width: 280px; height: 560px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    border-radius: 36px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .phone-screen {
    position: absolute; inset: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0d3b30 0%, #071a17 100%);
    border-radius: 24px; padding: 20px 16px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .phone-notch {
    width: 80px; height: 24px; background: rgba(7,26,23,0.9);
    border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }
  .phone-card {
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .phone-card-title { font-size: 10px; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .phone-card-name { font-size: 14px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }
  .phone-card-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .phone-bar { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .phone-pill {
    padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 9px;
    background: rgba(29,158,117,0.2); color: #5dcaa5; border: 1px solid rgba(29,158,117,0.3);
  }
  .phone-pill.gold { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.15); color: var(--gold-light); border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.3); }
  .phone-list { margin-top: 10px; }
  .phone-row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  }
  .phone-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .phone-avatar {
    width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mid); display: flex; align-items: center;
    justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--gold-light); font-weight: 500;
  }
  .phone-info { flex: 1; margin-left: 8px; }
  .phone-pname { font-size: 11px; color: var(--cream); }
  .phone-ptime { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .phone-status {
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5dcaa5;
  }
  .phone-status.waiting { background: var(--gold); }
  .floating-badge {
    position: absolute; right: -20px; top: 120px;
    background: var(--gold); color: var(--deep);
    padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .floating-badge2 {
    position: absolute; left: -30px; bottom: 160px;
    background: rgba(13,59,48,0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    color: var(--cream); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 11px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out 1.5s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes float { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(-8px)} }

  /* ── SECTION BASE ── */
  section { padding: 6rem 4rem; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .section-label::before { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.15; color: var(--white);
  }
  .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold-light); }

  /* ── HOW IT WORKS ── */
  .how {
    background: var(--teal);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
  }
  .how-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 5rem; align-items: start; margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .step {
    display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.8rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.08);
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .step-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    line-height: 1; min-width: 50px; transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .step.active .step-num { color: var(--gold); }
  .step-body { flex: 1; }
  .step-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .step.active .step-title { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .step-desc { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; display: none; }
  .step.active .step-desc { display: block; }
  .step-bar {
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px;
    background: var(--gold); transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: top;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .step.active .step-bar { transform: scaleY(1); }

  .step-visual {
    background: rgba(7,26,23,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.12);
    border-radius: 20px; padding: 2.5rem; min-height: 360px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .step-visual::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: -40px; right: -40px;
    width: 200px; height: 200px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08);
  }
  .visual-icon {
    font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .visual-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .visual-sub { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ── FEATURES ── */
  .features { background: var(--deep); }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5px; margin-top: 4rem;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feat {
    padding: 2.5rem; background: var(--teal);
    transition: background 0.25s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feat::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; right: -60px;
    width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .feat:hover { background: rgba(13,59,48,0.95); }
  .feat:hover::after { transform: scale(1.4); }
  .feat-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    width: 52px; height: 52px;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
  }
  .feat-title { font-size: 0.97rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .feat-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }

  /* ── DOCTORS ── */
  .doctors { background: var(--teal); }
  .doctors-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .doctor-card {
    background: rgba(7,26,23,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
  }
  .doctor-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .doctor-img {
    height: 220px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mid) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .doctor-avatar {
    width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(201,168,76,0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--gold-light);
  }
  .doctor-specialty {
    position: absolute; bottom: 12px; left: 12px;
    background: var(--gold); color: var(--deep);
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .doctor-info { padding: 1.4rem; }
  .doctor-name { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .doctor-sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .doctor-avail {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #5dcaa5;
  }
  .avail-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5dcaa5; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.4} }

  /* ── TESTIMONIAL ── */
  .testimonial {
    background: var(--deep); text-align: center; padding: 7rem 4rem;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .testimonial::before {
    content: '\201C';
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 20rem;
    color: rgba(201,168,76,0.04); position: absolute;
    top: -2rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    line-height: 1; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .testimonial-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic; color: var(--cream); max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem; line-height: 1.4; position: relative;
  }
  .testimonial-author { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  .cta-section {
    background: var(--gold); padding: 5rem 4rem; text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-section .section-label { color: rgba(7,26,23,0.6); justify-content: center; }
  .cta-section .section-label::before { background: rgba(7,26,23,0.4); }
  .cta-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--deep); margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem; line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .cta-sub { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(7,26,23,0.65); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .btn-dark {
    background: var(--deep); color: var(--gold);
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem; border: none; border-radius: 2px;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-dark:hover { background: var(--teal); color: var(--gold-light); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(7,26,23,0.3); }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: #030f0c; padding: 3rem 4rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08);
  }
  .footer-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .footer-brand .logo { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .footer-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .footer-col-title { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .footer-links a { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold-light); }
  .footer-bottom {
    padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.06);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  }
  .footer-bottom p { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.25); }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity:0; } to { opacity:1; } }

  .reveal {
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s, transform 0.7s;
  }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  /* Scroll bar */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--deep); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--gold); border-radius: 2px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="logo">
    <span class="logo-dot"></span> ClinicCare
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#how">Sida u shaqaysa</a></li>
    <li><a href="#features">Astaamaha</a></li>
    <li><a href="#doctors">Dhakhtarada</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Xiriir</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-cta">Bilow Hadda</button>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Nidaamka Ballanqaadyada Casriga ah</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Rugta waxaad<br>
      <em>si fudud</em> ugu<br>
      maamuleysa
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Nidaam dhijitaal ah oo bukaanada sugitaanka hoos u dhiga, faylasha degdeg u helo, 
      ballanqaadyadana si abaabulan u maareeya — rugta oo dhan hal meel.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#how" class="btn-primary">Bilow Bilaash</a>
      <a href="#features" class="btn-ghost">Wax Badan Ogow →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">85%</div>
        <div class="stat-lbl">Hoos u dhac sugitaanka</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">5s</div>
        <div class="stat-lbl">Raadinta faylka</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">100%</div>
        <div class="stat-lbl">Dhijitaal & Nidaaman</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="phone-mock">
      <div class="phone-screen">
        <div class="phone-notch"></div>
        <div class="phone-card">
          <div class="phone-card-title">Jadwalka Maanta</div>
          <div class="phone-card-name">Isniinta, 6 May 2026</div>
          <div class="phone-card-sub">Xarunta Caafimaadka Hargeysa</div>
          <div class="phone-bar">
            <span class="phone-pill">18 bukaanood</span>
            <span class="phone-pill gold">2 dhibaato</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-list">
          <div class="phone-row">
            <div class="phone-avatar">FA</div>
            <div class="phone-info">
              <div class="phone-pname">Fadumo Ali</div>
              <div class="phone-ptime">09:00 · Dr. Cabdi</div>
            </div>
            <div class="phone-status"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="phone-row">
            <div class="phone-avatar">MH</div>
            <div class="phone-info">
              <div class="phone-pname">Maxamed Hassan</div>
