      <div class="feat-desc">Qeex jadwalka dhakhtarka, sharafaha, iyo tirada bukaanka ee maalinle. Wax walba si toos ah ayaa u la xiriira.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="feat-icon">📊</div>
      <div class="feat-title">Warbixinta Tooska</div>
      <div class="feat-desc">Maamuluhu waxuu arki karaa tirooyinka muhiimka ah — bukaanka maanta, wakhtiga sugitaanka, dhakhtarada ugu mashquulka badan.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="feat-icon">📱</div>
      <div class="feat-title">Qaabab Kala Duwan</div>
      <div class="feat-desc">Desktop, tablet, ama mobile — nidaamku waa la isticmaali karaa qalab kasta. Xitaa offline ayuu shaqeeyaa korontada la'aanteed.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="feat-icon">🔒</div>
      <div class="feat-title">Amniga Xogta</div>
      <div class="feat-desc">Xogta bukaanka waa sir. Kaliya shaqaalaha ogolaanshaha leh ayaa arki kara. Waxwalba waa la kaydiyaa si nabadgalyo ah.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

